{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2019-11-13 22:30:00', 'title': 'MICHAEL KAPFER AND DIETER PIVRNEC ACQUIRED 80% STAKE IN LOWE GGK WERBEAGENTUR GMBH FROM THE INTERPUBLIC GROUP OF COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE:IPG).', 'text': 'MICHAEL KAPFER AND DIETER PIVRNEC ACQUIRED 80% STAKE IN LOWE GGK WERBEAGENTUR GMBH FROM THE INTERPUBLIC GROUP OF COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE:IPG) ON NOVEMBER 14, 2019. UNDER THE TERMS OF THE TRANSACTION, MICHAEL KAPFER AND DIETER PIVRNEC WILL ACQUIRE 40% STAKE EACH AND THE REMAINING THE INTERPUBLIC GROUP OF COMPANIES WILL RETAIN THE REMAINING 20%. UPON COMPLETION OF THE TRANSACTION, THE THREE COMPANY BRANDS WILL BE PRESERVED. GGK MULLENLOWE REPORTED A REVENUE OF €6.4 MILLION IN 2018. \nMICHAEL KAPFER AND DIETER PIVRNEC COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF 80% STAKE IN LOWE GGK WERBEAGENTUR GMBH FROM THE INTERPUBLIC GROUP OF COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE:IPG) ON NOVEMBER 14, 2019.\n'}